 t.sourcePages.push({pdf:'3.pdf',pdfPage:29,printedPage:'88',title:'Alkene preparation and physical properties; addition reactions',text:'Dehydrohalogenation heats an alkyl halide with alcoholic KOH, removing H and halogen from adjacent carbons to form an alkene; ethyl chloride gives ethene and HCl, which reacts with KOH to give KCl and H2O. First three alkenes (ethene, propene, butene) are gases; higher members are liquids/solids. Alkenes are non-polar, insoluble in water but soluble in organic solvents; melting/boiling points and density rise with molecular mass. Their C=C bond enables addition reactions. Halogens (F2, Cl2, Br2, etc.) add across the double bond; bromine in inert CCl4 is introduced.'},{pdf:'3.pdf',pdfPage:30,printedPage:'89',title:'Alkene unsaturation test and addition of HX/H2',text:'Bromine in CCl4 decolourizes rapidly with an alkene; without a double bond, reddish-brown colour remains, so bromine decolourization tests for C=C unsaturation. Adding hydrogen halides forms haloalkanes; source reactivity order is HI > HBr > HCl, and HBr adds to ethene to make bromoethane. Hydrogenation adds H2 across C=C to make ethane, with nickel at 250–300°C; the source describes hydrogenation as exothermic.'});
 t.summary.en+=' Alkenes form by dehydrohalogenation of alkyl halides with alcoholic KOH. Their physical properties vary with molecular size. Addition across C=C includes halogens (bromine decolourization tests unsaturation), hydrogen halides and hydrogenation to alkanes.';
 t.summary.ur+=' الکحل والے KOH سے alkyl halide کی dehydrohalogenation کے ذریعے alkenes بنتے ہیں۔ ان کی طبعی خصوصیات سالماتی کمیت کے ساتھ بدلتی ہیں۔ C=C پر addition میں halogens (bromine کا رنگ ختم ہونا unsaturation کا ٹیسٹ)، hydrogen halides اور hydrogenation سے alkanes بننا شامل ہے۔';
 t.summary.ps+=' د alcoholic KOH په وسیله د alkyl halide dehydrohalogenation alkenes جوړوي. فزیکي ځانګړنې یې د مالیکولي کتلې سره بدلېږي. د C=C addition کې halogens (د bromine رنګ ورکېدل د unsaturation ازموینه)، hydrogen halides او hydrogenation شامل دي چې alkanes جوړوي.';
